AGPL offline-only note
======================

TexasSolver and postflop-solver (and similar) are AGPL-licensed solvers.
This repository’s deployable web app (apps/web / Vercel / web Docker image)
must NEVER include solver binaries, WASM, or sources.

Packs are static data artifacts (manifest + strategy/index blobs).
Each CDN PackManifest sets provenance.ships_solver_code = false.

Not legal advice. Flag counsel before commercial use or any live-solve API.
